  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen support towards shock responsive social protection systems and operations, social accountability, analysis on secondary impacts of C-19 and to provide Personal Protection Equipment (PPEs) for social workers, staff of Judicial service departments and domestic violence and victims support units (DOVVSU) to support extremely poor and vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
